                    <p class=" coming-soon-regular" >Given the string label, XOR each character with the integer 13. Convert these integers back to a string and submit the flag as crypto{new_string}.</p>
                    <code class=" coming-soon-regular dotted">
def custom_xor(a, b):
    b_array = [ord(letter) for letter in b]
    res = []
    for number in b_array:
        res.append(number ^ a)
    return "".join(chr(r) for r in res)

